This patch allows the user to set whether certain actions
prompt the user for confirmation.

The actions are: saving, quitting, praying, looting, using a key
(or equivalent tool), untrapping, and breaking a wand.

You can set the options either in your config file, by putting
eg. YNCONFIRM=-w there to disable the wand-breaking confirmation,
or you can change the settings from the options menu.

This patch doesn't invalidate bones or saves.

Idea for this patch came from Boudewijn, see the "Loot prompt" thread.


